 tcl/board/netv2-rpi-spiflash.cfg    | 26 ++++++++++
 tcl/board/netv2-rpi.cfg             | 29 +++++++++++
 tcl/fpga/lattice-ecp5-traceid.cfg   | 35 +++++++++++++
